decision D-2: The seeded spec states the types and [F-1] in full and only names F-2 to F-4, which the assistant writes from the feature map; it is the plugin the Composer Plugin project template builds. Fills in [D-1].
  date: 2026-10-22
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:dmaretskyi
